    "Name": "Balac VTOL",
    "Details": "Introduced after the Jihad, the Balac Strike VTOL was an extremely fast and versatile VTOL. A low-cost 'budget' variant also introduced in 3079, both ATM's were downgraded to LRM-15s and the XL engine was swapped to a standard model. The ammo bay was reduced to compensate for the heavier engine.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar biomes.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 10/15 hexes / 300/450 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       100     15\n<b>Left</b>          60     15\n<b>Right</b>        60     15\n<b>Rear</b>         50     15\n\n<b>Total</b>      285     75</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Missiles</color>",
